     7385           dIsplay stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas no-error .
     7386           DOWN stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas.
     7387         run u-line in this-procedure.
     7388            if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     7389            "ИТОГО"                       CHR(9)
     7390            "ПО ВСЕМ ОБЬЕКТАМ"            CHR(9) CHR(9) CHR(9)  CHR(9)
     7391            excel-qnty(accum TOTAL f-qnty           )   CHR(9)
     7392            CHR(9)
     7393            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum       )   CHR(9)
     7394            CHR(9)
     7395            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-sum       )   CHR(9)
     7396            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-other     )   CHR(9)
     7397            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-free-qnty      )   CHR(9)
     7398            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-wait-qnty      )   CHR(9)
     7399            chr(10) .
